    "number": "Theorem 3.2",
    "quote": "For bandit instance $\\nu$, over horizon $\\horizon$, the expected cumulative cost regret ... and quality regret ... of the PE algorithm are upper bounded respectively as, (1 + \\max_{i \\leq a^*} \\frac{32 \\log(T \\gap_{Q, i}^2)}{\\gap_{Q, i}^2}) \\gap_{C, \\ell}^+ + (\\sum_{i = 1}^{a^*} \\frac{43}{ \\gap_{Q, i}^2 }) \\gap_{C, \\ell}^+ + \\frac{43}{\\gap_{Q, a^*}^2} \\max_{a^* < i \\leq \\ell} \\gap_{C, i}^+"
